---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LegalsLink from '../../components/legals_link.astro';

const companyName = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_COMPANY_NAME;
---
<Layout pageTitle="Accessibility Statement">
    <div class="container my-5">
        <LegalsLink />
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col">
                
                
            <h1>Accessibility Statement</h1>
<h2>Our Commitment</h2>
<p>{companyName} is committed to providing a website that is accessible to the widest possible audience, regardless of technology or ability. We aim to comply with Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) and continuously improve the accessibility of our website.</p>
<h2>Measures Taken</h2>
<p>We have implemented several measures to ensure accessibility:</p>
<h3>Technical Implementation</h3>
<ul>
<li>Optimized website performance (as measured by PageSpeed Insights)</li>
<li>Semantic HTML structure</li>
<li>Proper heading hierarchy</li>
<li>Alternative text for images</li>
<li>Keyboard navigation support</li>
<li>Responsive design for all screen sizes</li>
<li>Adequate color contrast</li>
<li>Clear, readable fonts</li>
</ul>
<h3>Content Design</h3>
<ul>
<li>Clear and consistent navigation</li>
<li>Descriptive link text</li>
<li>Structured content layout</li>
<li>Easy-to-read content</li>
<li>Consistent formatting</li>
</ul>
<h3>Forms and Interactive Elements</h3>
<ul>
<li>Clear form labels</li>
<li>Error identification</li>
<li>Focus indicators</li>
<li>Adequate time to complete actions</li>
<li>No rapid flashing content</li>
</ul>

<h2>Testing</h2>
<p>Our website is regularly tested for accessibility using:</p>
<ul>
<li>PageSpeed Insights</li>
<li>Automated accessibility tools</li>
<li>Manual testing</li>
<li>Screen reader compatibility checks</li>
<li>Encounter any accessibility barriers</li>
<li>Need information in a different format</li>
<li>Have suggestions for improvement</li>
</ul>
<h2>Future Improvements</h2>
<p>We are committed to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Regular accessibility audits</li>
<li>Ongoing staff training</li>
<li>Continuous improvement of our website</li>
<li>Staying current with accessibility standards</li>
</ul>
<p>We are working to achieve the highest levels of accessibility. However,  
    if you may encounter any issues please email them to tony@proactiveweb.design</p>
<p>This statement was last updated on 19th June 2025.</p>
            </div>
        </div>        
    </div>
</Layout>


